      "writtenOn": "2023-11-29T15:13:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Does it look good? One caveat is that we may forget to amend the variable. Or any other suggestions?\n\n\nAt some point we will definitely forget to update the variable :) We should look in the solutions where the get list of supported kernels from the device, and run tests against all of them. Having said that, I don\u0027t have an idea on how we can achieve this. Happy to brainstorm this with you if you want :)\n\nAlso, feel free to address this comment in a follow-up patch.",
